  "rollback_plan": "Disable by setting FailureArtifactRetentionDays=0 and FailureArtifactCleanupTargetGB=0. To fully roll back, remove the cleanup route contract and Tauri route, remove the cleanup service/facade command and planner policy, remove the two settings from Python and PowerShell config schemas, remove Reports cleanup controls, regenerate inventories/schemas, and rerun the focused Local API/WebView tests.",
