  ],
  "notes": "High-risk evidence deletion is constrained to backend-resolved LocalBase\\State\\Failures\\Artifacts and legacy LocalBase\\Failed\\Artifacts roots. Confirmed deletion requires dry_run=false, confirm_delete=true, non-empty reason, matching dry-run fingerprint, and UI typed confirmation. The backend revalidates every file path with root containment checks and refuses symlinks/non-files before unlinking. Cleanup writes a manifest under State\\Failures\\ClearManifests. The route reports touches_media=false and source_media_mutation=false."
